I am drinking my morning coffee.
Now it is the month of February.
I am looking at my calendar.
I go to the office every day.
I go to the office at nine o'clock.
My work finishes at five o'clock.
I want to go to the gym regularly now.
I choose two days on the calendar.
Tuesday and Thursday.
At what time is the gym?
At half past five in the evening.
I write this time in the calendar.
On Tuesday evening at half past five.
And on Thursday evening at half past five.
I finish my coffee.
My schedule is ready.
I am very happy.
